I downloaded the GLAExtensions-AC-4.5.0.3-200909240916.zip to my Windows box.
I unziped the file and checked in the following files to the 
adks/ibm/actl_gla/4.5.0.3 in cmvc:

- glacomponents.jar
- IBMsecEvents.jar
- icuwrapper.jar
- logparsers.jar

This package also bundles its own version of tptp-gla that use to be part of eclipse but its not there
now, so they keep up with there own versions.  We bundle these as well:
- hexr.jar
- hparse.jar
- hgla.jar
- hlcore.jar
- tlcore.jar
- hlcbe101.jar
- the schema directory and all files in that directory.

